  "body": "`includes` has been a reserved keyword since we introduced mixins, but IndexedDB is using that word for an operation: https://github.com/w3c/IndexedDB/commit/98b28b9890eb92b36eaadbedb31cea2d3bcd64aa\r\n\r\n```webidl\r\n[Exposed=(Window,Worker)]\r\ninterface IDBKeyRange {\r\n  // -- snip --\r\n\r\n  boolean _includes(any key);\r\n};\r\n```\r\n\r\n@bzbarsky raised a concern that we shouldn't force escaping here. What do you think?",
